{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Vyv2eLQKLN1793259703.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政務司司長陳國基指，將就獨立委員會提出的建議全面改革，包括成立督導委員會逐一檢視落實；並建立跨部門中央數據系統，強化樓宇安全、消防及維修資訊共享與風險預警，改革投訴機制以AI分析跟進，加強「以民為本」培訓。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203507-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E8%A8%AD%E7%9D%A3%E5%B0%8E%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告｜政府推全面改革　設督導委員會及中央數據系統｜一文看清</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.794098+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:17.568374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:23.728565+00:00","content_hash":"fa172634794567428f1fff1d5af7055d28baf4560161419c9d6473d80a3f1920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.794098+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}